.TH TWODRIVE-SETTINGS 1 "October 2026" "TwoDrive" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
twodrive-settings \- configure the TwoDrive desktop integration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B twodrive-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens the GTK settings window to inspect the connection, pending operations,
cache, and known-folder backup configuration. Requires a graphical session.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR twodrive (1)
